{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50196","headline":"同李司仓早春宴睢阳东亭（得花） · 高适","name":"同李司仓早春宴睢阳东亭（得花）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春臯宜晚景，芳树杂流霞。\n鸎鷰知三月，池台称百花。\n竹根初带笋，槐色正开牙。\n且莫催行骑，归时有月华。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50196.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50196","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}